WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:03.545
(Engine revving)
(Police sirens)

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:04.463
They found us.

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:11.637
♪♪

00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:14.556
Justin:
Mosquito Coast was written by
my Uncle Paul. 

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:17.226
Who I'm the middle namesake of
him, "Justin Paul Theroux."

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:20.103
The main character is played by
Justin Theroux.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:23.398
Paul:
My nephew, sometimes he calls
himself "Justin Theroux."

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:25.984
(Chuckle) It's a French name,
it's "Theroux."

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:28.445
You want me to say we had a
bond?

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:29.780
Yes, I do!

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.823
Margot:
We had a bond!

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:35.494
I remember this book came out in
the early to mid-80's

00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:36.453
when I was a kid. 

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:39.289
Justin:
I actually read it maybe a
couple of years after it came out. 

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:41.500
This thing reeks of nepotism,

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.252
but my manager said they're 
doing "Mosquito Coast."

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:45.337
I said, "Oh, let' s track it."

00:00:45.337 --> 00:00:46.922
And then I read it and fell in
love with it

00:00:46.922 --> 00:00:49.049
and then I was actually actively
pursuing it. 

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.884
I didn't know that he was
auditioning.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.928
Paul:
I didn't know that he was
involved in it. 

00:00:52.928 --> 00:00:56.473
Paul:
I didn't even know that he had a
great passion for the book. 

00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:58.850
I'm really delighted that he did
it. 

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:02.479
Paul:
And there are some lines that
are not in the book that are in the series

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:05.565
that Justin has channeled from
family history.

00:01:06.275 --> 00:01:09.319
That's a problem, what's the
solution?

00:01:09.319 --> 00:01:12.614
♪♪

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:14.616
It's hard to give a little
family background 

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:16.410
without giving a lot of family
background.

00:01:16.702 --> 00:01:20.580
Justin:
But the character of Allie Fox
in the book is based loosely

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.249
Justin:
on multiple family members.

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:25.752
Justin:
One of them I'd say safe to say
is my grandfather Albert Theroux,

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.921
who was a very industrious man.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.673
Not everything can be fixed,
Dad.

00:01:29.673 --> 00:01:30.924
Of course it can.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:34.761
In the book, Allie Fox is
driving himself.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:37.764
The Allie Fox of the series,
he's a man pursued.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:38.390
(Police sirens)

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:41.351
It's the same spirit with a
different setting.

00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:43.020
(Helicopter engine)

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:45.314
Justin:
The character of Allie Fox is a
person who's

00:01:45.314 --> 00:01:48.233
Justin:
genuinely trying to give his
children a better life.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:49.860
And his family a better life. 

00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:52.863
Paul: 
In a way it has come full circle

00:01:52.863 --> 00:01:55.115
that I was writing about my
family.

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:58.076
And now, a member of my family
is in it. 

00:01:58.076 --> 00:02:02.039
♪♪

00:02:02.039 --> 00:02:03.457
So where next?

00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:07.586
♪♪

